---
description: >-
  `eventmodeling.curve` (D733, D748, #1380) draws every relation between frames over the top-level
  `curve`: S-curves here (`basis`), where the default keeps straight and right-angled lines. Each
  arrowhead follows the end of its line; the frame that names itself keeps its loop. Sources the
  validator rejects (event to event, a frame to itself) are what give a relation along a lane,
  under a row and a loop.
config:
  curve: linear
  eventmodeling:
    curve: basis
---
eventmodeling
tf 01 cmd Start
tf 02 evt Started ->> 01
tf 03 evt Continued ->> 02
tf 04 evt Finished ->> 03 ->> 02
tf 05 rmo Status ->> 04 ->> 02
tf 06 ui Screen ->> 05 ->> 06
tf 07 cmd Retry ->> 06
rf 08 evt Retried ->> 07
tf 09 rmo Again
